### Layer 2 — POS Micro-Features (Tenant Settings)

These are **toggles the owner controls** in POS Settings. Each has a minimum plan requirement.

| Feature Key | What It Does | Min Plan | Default |
|---|---|---|---|
| `pos_tax_enabled` | Show tax line on transactions | Standard | `false` |
| `pos_tax_rate` | Tax percentage (e.g. 0.15 for 15% VAT) | Standard | `0` |
| `pos_tax_label` | Label shown on receipt (e.g. "VAT", "NHIL+GETFund") | Standard | `"Tax"` |
| `pos_credit_enabled` | Allow "Sell on Credit" in register | Standard | `false` |
| `pos_wholesale_enabled` | Show wholesale price toggle in register | Business | `false` |
| `pos_discounts_enabled` | Allow cashier to apply item discounts | Standard | `true` |
| `pos_service_charge_enabled` | Add service charge % to total | Business | `false` |
| `pos_service_charge_rate` | Service charge % | Business | `0` |
| `pos_split_payment_enabled` | Allow payment across multiple methods | Standard | `false` |
| `pos_notes_enabled` | Allow cashier to add order notes | Starter | `true` |
| `pos_barcode_scan_enabled` | Enable barcode scanner input | Starter | `true` |
| `pos_customer_required` | Force cashier to link customer to sale | Business | `false` |
| `pos_price_override_enabled` | Allow cashier to manually override price | Business | `false` |

