## Edge Cases & Error Handling

| Scenario | How to Handle |
|---|---|
| Feature fetch fails at login | Fail-safe to **most restrictive** (Starter) — never crash the app |
| Mid-session plan upgrade | Server responds with 200+new features; frontend re-fetches features on next page load |
| Mid-session plan downgrade | Server enforces at API level; frontend shows 403 → `UpgradeWall`; next login refreshes state |
| Cashier tries to use credit (disabled) | Button is hidden in UI + server returns 403 if attempted via API |
| Stale feature cache | Re-fetch features every 30min or on tab focus |
| Add-on trial expires during session | Server returns 402 on protected endpoints; frontend catches 402 and shows `UpgradeWall` |
| Network error fetching features | Show cached last-known state (from localStorage); banner: "Feature status may be outdated" |
| Owner changes POS settings | Broadcast update to all open tabs via `localStorage` event or re-fetch |

